Package: lagrange
Title: FIML Covariance Projection for Longitudinal Missing Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Xiyuan", "Guo", email = "tommyguo039@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits a latent growth model via FIML, extracts the model-implied
    covariance matrix, and projects an initial imputation onto that structural
    manifold using Lagrangian-constrained gradient descent. Supports both
    single imputation (lagrange_fiml) and proper multiple imputation via
    parameter perturbation (lagrange_mi).
